omments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-07T10:51:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T10:40:34Z","closed_at":"2025-03-07T18:11:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103756","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103756.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103756.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-07T18:11:01Z"},"body":"Visual shader has a custom inspector plugin for its `mode` property. Partial translation occurs here because we don't extract enum hints currently. So this dropdown should disable auto translation like the default ones.\r\n\r\n![ksnip_20250307-183934](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02f104e1-d442-4ce1-a7bd-b65b99688d48)\r\n\r\nIn the visual shader graph, there are nodes for selecting shader input / varying / parameter via a dropdown. Most items here should not be translated because they are built-in variable names or user-defined names. The only exception is the default value `[None]`. It should be marked and translated.\r\n\r\n![ksnip_20250307-183801](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13a23417-949b-4a66-8221-0d96a2518ff3)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repo